(c4) AD[I adore thee devoutly, hidden Deity](c)ó(e')ro(g) te(g') de(g)vó(gh)te,(g.) (,) la(f')tens(e) Dé(d')i(c)tas,(c.) (;)
Quae[who under these figures truly hidest](c') sub[](e) his(g') fi(g)gú(gh)ris(g.) (,) ve(f')re(e) lá(d')ti(c)tas :(c.) (:)
Ti[to thee my heart itself](g')bi(g) se[](hi) cor(j) me(ji)um(g.) (,) to[wholly](h')tum(g) súb[is subject](f')ji(e)cit,(d.) (;)
Qui[because contemplating thee it wholly fails](e')a(g) te(f') con(e)tém(dc)plans,(d.) (,) to[](e')tum(c) dé(d')fi(c)cit.(c.) (::)
2. Vi[sight, touch, taste, in thee is mistaken](c')sus,(e) ta[](g')ctus,(g) gu[](gh)stus(g.) (,) in[](f') te(e) fál(d')li(c)tur,(c.) (;)
Sed[but](c') au[by hearing alone](e)dí(g')tu(g) so(gh)lo[/](g.) (,) tu[safely is believed](f')to(e) cré(d')di(c)tur :(c.) (:)
Cre[I believe whatsoever said God's Son](g')do(g) quid[](hi)quid(j) di(ji)xit(g.) (,) De(h')i(g) Fí(f')li(e)us :(d.) (;)
Nil[nothing than this word of truth truer](e') hoc(g) ver(f')bo(e) Ve(dc)ri(d)tá(e')tis(c) vé(d')ri(c)us.(c.) (::)
